| +-- UserController: Profile management, user operations         |
| +-- SecurityService: JWT handling, session management           |
| +-- UserService: Business logic for user operations             |
| +-- UserRepository: Data persistence for user entities          |
| +-- SecurityConfig: Spring Security configuration               |
|                                                                 |
| Responsibilities:                                               |
| +-- JWT-based authentication with token refresh                 |
| +-- Role-based authorization (ADMIN, CUSTOMER)                  |
| +-- User profile and preference management                      |
| +-- Password security with BCrypt encryption                    |
| +-- Session management and security policy enforcement          |
