\subsubsection{Payment Compliance Test Cases}
\label{subsubsec:payment-test-cases-detailed}

\paragraph{Unit Test Cases - Payment Service Layer}

\textbf{TC-PC-001: Payment Processing Workflow}
\begin{verbatim}
Test Case ID: TC-PC-001
Description: Validate complete payment processing workflow

Test Scenario: Standard Monthly Payment
Input Data:
- PaymentPlanId: 1L
- Amount: $250.00
- PaymentMethod: CREDIT_CARD
- CustomerToken: valid-customer-token

Mock Configuration:
- paymentPlanRepository.findById(1L) returns active plan
- externalPaymentService.processPayment() returns success
- paymentRepository.save() returns persisted payment

Test Steps:
1. Validate payment request parameters
2. Verify payment plan exists and is active
3. Process payment through external service
4. Create payment record in database
5. Update payment plan status if needed
6. Send confirmation notification

Expected Outcomes:
- PaymentResult with success status
- Payment record created with correct details
- Payment plan next due date updated
- Confirmation notification triggered
- Transaction audit trail created
\end{verbatim}

\textbf{TC-PC-002: Payment Failure Scenarios}
\begin{verbatim}
Test Case ID: TC-PC-002
Description: Test various payment failure conditions

Failure Scenarios Matrix:
+-- External Service Failures
|   +-- Insufficient funds
|   +-- Invalid payment method
|   +-- Network timeout
|   +-- Service unavailable
|
+-- Data Validation Failures
|   +-- Invalid payment amount
|   +-- Inactive payment plan
|   +-- Expired payment method
|   +-- Duplicate transaction
|
+-- System Failures
    +-- Database connection loss
    +-- Transaction rollback
    +-- Notification service failure
    +-- Audit logging failure

For each scenario:
1. Configure appropriate mock responses
2. Execute payment processing
3. Verify proper error handling
4. Confirm no partial state changes
5. Validate error logging and notifications
\end{verbatim}

\paragraph{Integration Test Cases - Payment API Layer}

\textbf{TC-PC-101: End-to-End Payment Processing}
\begin{verbatim}
Test Case ID: TC-PC-101
Description: Complete payment workflow through REST API

Test Setup:
1. Create customer account with active payment plan
2. Configure test payment method
3. Set up payment plan with $250 monthly payment

API Request:
POST /payments/process
Authorization: Bearer <customer-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentPlanId": 1,
  "amount": 250.00,
  "paymentMethod": {
    "type": "CREDIT_CARD",
    "token": "test-cc-token"
  }
}

Test Execution:
1. Submit payment request
2. Monitor external payment service calls
3. Verify database state changes
4. Check notification delivery
5. Validate audit trail creation

Expected Results:
- HTTP 200 OK status
- Payment confirmation response
- Database records updated correctly
- Customer notification sent
- Service status remains active
\end{verbatim}

